  (text "Notes\nU28: VSEL to GND2 = 3.3 V out (140 mA)\nR170: EN/FLT high (VIO level) enables the DC/DC; reads low on a fault\nU30: pinout checked (SBAS660, 31 Oct). Internal 4.096 MHz clock (CLK to DGND), START low (conversions by command), DOUT/DRDY on one pin\nC147: REFOUT to REFCOM\nR172: RTD reference resistor, 10 ppm/K\nC149: CHECK AINCOM and the TC bias against the io-node schematic\nC150: differential filter\nR173: open-TC bias\nR179: RTD return to the reference resistor\nJ19: T1 +/-, T2 +/-, RTD return\nJ20: T3 +/-, T4 +/-, RTD return"
    (at 15.24 347.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid fb724f74-9ae1-51ea-8c7f-21b116fcd1e8)
  )
  (text "\nJ21: T5 +/-, T6 +/-, RTD return\nU31: VSEL to VISOOUT = 5 V out (110 mA)\nR182: EN/FLT high (VIO level) enables the DC/DC; reads low on a fault\nU33: loop power 6 x 22 mA + level + mass-flow supply, about 4 W\nU34: internal oscillator and 2.5 V reference. VIN0/1: 4-20 mA ch 5/6 on shunts; VIN2 level; VIN3 mass flow; VIN4 10 V monitor; VIN5 5 V monitor. Pinout checked (31 Oct); CHECK the exposed pad size against\n    the CP-40 drawing\nR184: 4-20 mA shunt -> 1-5 V; takes the 30 mA limit for ever (0.23 W)\nR185: 4-20 mA shunt -> 1-5 V; takes the 30 mA limit for ever (0.23 W)\nF16: loop current limit; shorted loop = 0.7 W: copper on the cathode. CHECK the 30 mA option, its 2.5 V headroom and the AD4112 IIN abs max\nJ22: per channel: 24 V loop, IN, 0 V (2-wire or 4-wire transmitters)\nJ23: per channel: 24 V loop, IN, 0 V (2-wire or 4-wire transmitters)"
    (at 203.2 347.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid c6b15fa1-76dd-5328-9cec-98726f869f1d)
  )
  (text "\nJ24: per channel: 24 V loop, IN, 0 V (2-wire or 4-wire transmitters)\nU35: level sensor 5 V, internal current limit\nR186: defined level when unplugged\nU36: 13 V pre-regulator, about 0.5 W: copper on the VO pins\nR188: 1.25 x (1 + 2260/240) = 13.0 V\nU38: SET driven by the REF5010 (no RSET). CHECK PGFB tie when PG is unused\nR189: about 50 mA current limit\nR190: 10 V monitor for ratiometric correction\nD49: clamps +5V_LVL\nD50: clamps +10V_FLOW (12.2 V min breakdown)\nJ25: level (DFRobot SEN0205): 5 V, SIG, 0 V; mass flow (AWM5104VN): +10 V, OUT, 0 V"
    (at 391.16 347.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 518eddcf-0a7d-5a4e-9fc2-583db52e5266)
  )

